  "notes": [
    "Reset: replaceContract of LoanClosingsWith (selectors closeWithDeposit and closeWithSwap). iUSDT's LoanTokenLogicLM, which minted mid-close without a cross-contract guard, was registered 15 blocks earlier in the same batch, so it does not move the age.",
    "Campaign: 35 further rUSDT-leg and 38 RBTC-leg drains; the setup borrows are not listed. Excluded 0x4dda1cc8, whose iRBTC mint and burn returned the attacker's 15 WRBTC and left an over-collateralised loan. AMM repayments of the attacker's own collateral are netted.",
    "RBTC is valued at the BTC quote inside the RBTC-leg window (DefiLlama has no WRBTC sample there). No public RSK RPC serves traces or logs, so earlier exploits of the module were not scanned beyond the attacker's history; Sovryn's post-mortem matches these totals within 0.4%."
